{
  "abstract": "A Lean formalization of the main result (Theorem 1) of the paper  \"A new type of superorthogonality\" by P. T. Gressman, L. B. Pierce, J. Roos, and P.-L. Yung; arXiv:2212.08956, Proc. Amer. Math. Soc. 152, 665-675, 2024. The theorem provides a simple criterion on a family of functions that implies a square function estimate on Lp for every even integer p ≥ 2. This defines a new type of superorthogonality that is verified by checking a less restrictive criterion than any other type of superorthogonality previously known.",
